# Balance preview of the non-live content (generated)

Generated by `npm run balance:preview` (`tools/balance/preview.ts`) from `src/gameplay/data/planned.json`. Do not edit by hand. Reported only: nothing here is gated, and none of this content is live.

Bases: generated at each Keep with mid-level buildings, 2 seed(s) × 3 layout(s) (random, kunai_ring, walled_keep). Armies fill the Keep's housing at its research caps and use the bot plan. Destruction % averaged over the bases.

## Buildings

Each planned building is added at its catalog max level for the Keep (the Living Bamboo Wall replaces the Stone Walls). **Δ building** = with it − without it; **Δ effect** = with it − with its body only (the effect switched off). A counter doing its job shows a clearly negative Δ effect against "it beats" and little against "beats it". Events: counter actions per fight (every counter on the base, live ones included).

| Building | Keep | Army | Base % | With it % | Δ building | Δ effect | Events |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|

